      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jim, do you know much about what exactly can happen if `AHardwareBuffer_lock` is called when the buffer is already locked from another thread or process, or writes haven\u0027t completed before calling it? Is there any way this can be made safe?",
      "revId": "3ec830380a6787e06fd0b8c1d5fd3d77397162d4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
